{"3779440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deluge", "steam_appid": 3779440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/93a0283262716b51cf8b2f902d2940c8.avif?t=1783301992\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras_big/93a0283262716b51cf8b2f902d2940c8.webp?t=1783301992 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/0d52c57fb08319ba2a8adf9c62551c3d.webp?t=1783301992\" width=784 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a resurrected warrior in service to an evil entity known as Ganglim. Your instruction is to finish off a terrorized community after they've settled into their new home. How you accomplish this task is left in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village of Figaro is full of locked doors, buried history, and the occasional monster in a box. Explore at your own pace, choose where to go and who to trust, and decide whether you’ll rely on your sword, your magic, or your conscience to withstand the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you carry out your new orders, or embrace who you once were?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/7a110943c9d96910108c5703c60b0883.webp?t=1783301992\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/5db39eb6ed1e06ad4e415ffb59ed22be.avif?t=1783301992\" width=1326 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/893450cf5b3e81d4b88688ca18f1eb8c.webp?t=1783301992\" width=624 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deluge</strong> is a dark, atmospheric 16-bit RPG about memory, morality, and a history that refuses to stay buried. Blending classic JRPG combat with psychological horror, Deluge invites players into a melancholic adventure filled with turn-based battles, branching storytelling, and countless secrets waiting beneath the surface.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the story of Figaro through an immersive audio and 16-bit visual experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade blows in over-the-shoulder, turn-based combat encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions that impact the progression and outcome of Figaro’s story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a massive soundtrack of <strong>40+ original songs</strong> by Jazzweather and friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a world inspired by cult RPGs from the early internet era</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/d3318eb24082d4f907ef2e992aeb254a.avif?t=1783301992\" width=600 height=212 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/93a0283262716b51cf8b2f902d2940c8.avif?t=1783301992\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras_big/93a0283262716b51cf8b2f902d2940c8.webp?t=1783301992 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/0d52c57fb08319ba2a8adf9c62551c3d.webp?t=1783301992\" width=784 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a resurrected warrior in service to an evil entity known as Ganglim. Your instruction is to finish off a terrorized community after they've settled into their new home. How you accomplish this task is left in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village of Figaro is full of locked doors, buried history, and the occasional monster in a box. Explore at your own pace, choose where to go and who to trust, and decide whether you’ll rely on your sword, your magic, or your conscience to withstand the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you carry out your new orders, or embrace who you once were?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/7a110943c9d96910108c5703c60b0883.webp?t=1783301992\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/5db39eb6ed1e06ad4e415ffb59ed22be.avif?t=1783301992\" width=1326 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/893450cf5b3e81d4b88688ca18f1eb8c.webp?t=1783301992\" width=624 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deluge</strong> is a dark, atmospheric 16-bit RPG about memory, morality, and a history that refuses to stay buried. Blending classic JRPG combat with psychological horror, Deluge invites players into a melancholic adventure filled with turn-based battles, branching storytelling, and countless secrets waiting beneath the surface.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the story of Figaro through an immersive audio and 16-bit visual experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade blows in over-the-shoulder, turn-based combat encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions that impact the progression and outcome of Figaro’s story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a massive soundtrack of <strong>40+ original songs</strong> by Jazzweather and friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a world inspired by cult RPGs from the early internet era</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/extras/d3318eb24082d4f907ef2e992aeb254a.avif?t=1783301992\" width=600 height=212 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Deluge is a horror-centric JRPG where you play as the resurrected warrior Hudson, a corpse tasked with infiltrating a battered community. Bound to a tyrant’s will, yet haunted by your own past, you must make choices and battle your path forward to either redemption or ruin.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/cb0d33664dbe3fff1437e66052917c7e95ec8b1f/header.jpg?t=1783301992", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779440/2eb860dfe5acca9776a2643d18f752619093880d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783301992", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets